+# Contributing to the Madeira Wine fork (LGPL branch)
+
+Contributions to this fork are accepted under **LGPL-2.1-or-later**, the
+same licence as upstream Wine, per the Developer Certificate of Origin
+(https://developercertificate.org/). Do not remove or alter upstream
+copyright or licence notices. Changes suitable for upstream should go to
+WineHQ first.
